		{"id":"proj-ai-perriplatform-v3-2-0","type":"text","text":"# PERRI Enterprise Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot|AI_PERRIPlatform_v3.2.0]]\n### Production\n\n**INTERNAL PLATFORM - shared AI channel**\nEnterprise Q&A and orchestration channel shared by every domain; not attached to any single WFX module.\nBaseline: PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot.v3.2","x":2925,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":660,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-applicationhub-v2-1-0","type":"text","text":"# PPJ AI Hub\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1|AI_ApplicationHub_v2.1.0]]\n### Internal Production Platform\n\n**INTERNAL PLATFORM - AI access / governance**\nAI application access, orchestration and governance foundation; not attached to any single WFX module.\nBaseline: PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1","x":4525,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":660,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-ppj-glpi-helpdesk-ai-chatbot-v1-0","type":"text","text":"# GLPI AI Helpdesk (Merchandising)\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot|PPJ.GLPI.Helpdesk.AI.Chatbot.v1.0]]\n### Maintenance\n\n**AI APPLICATION - helpdesk / knowledge assistant**\nAI helpdesk for merchandisers: enterprise systems, WFX usage, merchandising process, SOP, troubleshooting and previously resolved issues.","x":6125,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":660,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"shared-note","type":"text","text":"### Enterprise capabilities, not business-domain applications.\nPERRI and AI Hub are shared channels: they are deliberately not attached to individual WFX modules. Lines are drawn only where documentation confirms use.","x":2925,"y":930,"width":4650,"height":220},
		{"id":"tp-power-bi","type":"text","text":"## Power BI\nReporting / BI","x":6630,"y":3690,"width":1200,"height":200,"color":"#a0522d"},
		{"id":"tp-note","type":"text","text":"### On the owner's operating-systems diagram:\n### HRIS, E-office, MMSx, FastReactPlan, Gerber, ShapeShifter\n\n### Confirmed by vault documents, not on the diagram:\n### VNPT E-Invoice, Power BI, GLPI, IoT / WISER / INA\n\nOnly listed applications are drawn. No further vendor application is assumed. E-office: service stopped; reopening needs a fee (vendor re-quoting, BOD 24/09).","x":3990,"y":3000,"width":2520,"height":880},
		{"id":"eco-title","type":"text","text":"# PPJ GROUP - Digital Application, AI & Automation Ecosystem\n## ERP -> Enterprise Applications -> Internal Systems -> AI & Automation","x":0,"y":-1700,"width":10500,"height":260},
		{"id":"eco-subtitle","type":"text","text":"### Portfolio Baseline: 19/09/2026  |  Vault Reconciliation: 28/09/2026 (portfolio snapshot)\nGenerated From: PPJ AI & Automation Portfolio (vault registry) + PPJ operating-systems landscape ([[02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape|Operational Systems Landscape]]). Regenerated automatically when the portfolio snapshot changes.","x":0,"y":-1420,"width":10500,"height":200},
		{"id":"eco-exec-summary","type":"text","text":"# PPJ DIGITAL EVOLUTION\n\n### 1. WFX provides the ERP transaction backbone.\n### 2. Third-party enterprise applications provide specialized capabilities.\n### 3. GTAS applications were built internally to fill operational capability gaps.\n### 4. AI & Automation selectively augment specific modules and business flows.\n### 5. Shared data, knowledge and AI platforms serve reusable cross-functional capabilities.\n### 6. AI does not replace the ERP; it augments ERP, enterprise systems and decisions.","x":0,"y":-1180,"width":3300,"height":900},
		{"id":"eco-principles","type":"text","text":"# ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES\n\n### - WFX remains core ERP / transaction backbone.\n### - AI projects augment rather than duplicate source systems.\n### - System of record must remain explicit.\n### - Prefer API-based integration where available.\n### - Business affinity does not imply technical integration.\n### - Human review remains required for uncertain AI decisions.\n### - Reusable data / knowledge layers serve multiple projects.\n### - Shared AI services reduce duplicate implementations.\n### - Status and lifecycle are independent from business domain.","x":3600,"y":-1180,"width":3300,"height":900},
		{"id":"eco-inventory","type":"text","text":"# PORTFOLIO INVENTORY\n\n## Baseline 19/09/2026 - 35 initiatives\n### Active / Dev 16 | Production 6 | Maintenance 4 | Closed 4 | On Hold 3 | Evaluation 2\n\n## Current Vault 28/09/2026 - 36 registered records\n### Production 8 | Active / Dev 9 | UAT / Eval / Analysis 5 | Maintenance 4 | On Hold 3 | Closed 7\n\nBaseline is kept unchanged. Bucket definitions differ - see the gap notes.","x":7200,"y":-1180,"width":3300,"height":900},
		{"id":"proj-mer-marketintelligence-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Market Intelligence\n## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0]]\n### Active Intelligence\n\n**AI APPLICATION - data intelligence**\nProduct, customer and material opportunities from DWH, order history, Style Library and external market signals. An intelligence layer, not a WFX transaction app.\nBaseline: MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1","x":100,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":700,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-pocommit-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# PO Commit Automation\n## [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit|MER_POCommit_v1.1.0]]\n### Closed\n\n**AUTOMATION**\nCustomer order to order processing to PO, ready for production; covered about 70-80% of customer scenarios. Historical record.\nBaseline: MER.PO.Commit.v1.1","x":100,"y":970,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-invoicedatarecheck-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Invoice Data Recheck\n## [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1|MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0]]\n### Production / Support\n\n**AUTOMATION - audit / rule engine**\nCross-checks costing, commercial and invoice data against configurable per-customer rules, across multiple customers; exceptions go to human review.\nBaseline: MER.INVOICE.DATA.RECHECK.v1.1","x":100,"y":1670,"width":1450,"height":700,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-mer-costingagenticplatform-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Agentic Costing Platform\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n### Active Development\n\n**AI APPLICATION - agents / decision support**\nSimilar-style retrieval, technical data and consumption to a costing recommendation. Sew Agent and Wash Agent are parts of this platform; a domain expert confirms.\nBaseline: COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1","x":100,"y":2430,"width":1450,"height":700,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"source-systems-diagram","type":"file","file":"99_Attachments/PPJ_Operational_Systems_Landscape_Diagram.png","x":-4600,"y":-1700,"width":3200,"height":1775},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-prod","type":"text","text":"# 04.4 PRODUCTION + WASH","x":8880,"y":8180,"width":1363,"height":170},
		{"id":"proj-prod-hanginglineiot-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# Hanging Line IoT\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0]]\n### Development\n\n**IOT**\nHanging-line digitization and production visibility for Production Management and WFX Reporting & Analysis; a future data source for Smart Factory analytics.\nBaseline: PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo.v1.0","x":8950,"y":8370,"width":1450,"height":700,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"guide","type":"text","text":"# HOW TO READ THIS CANVAS\n\n### Zoomed out - coverage: a badge on a WFX / GTAS module means AI / automation already touches it.\n### Hover or click - detail: the exact modules, systems and projects, with the line type.\n### Centre, top to bottom: shared AI platforms, GTAS, third-party, WFX ERP core, data / knowledge foundation. Left and right: AI & Automation projects by business domain.\n\n## INTERACTION\n### - Hover an AI / Automation project: show its connected enterprise modules\n### - Hover a WFX / GTAS module: show the AI / Automation projects related to it\n### - Click: pin the focus    - Esc or click the background: reset\n### - Command 'PPJ Canvas Focus: Toggle presentation / editing mode'\n\nA line exists only where a vault document or the BOD connection matrix supports it; no line means no relationship is documented. Interaction needs the PPJ Canvas Focus plugin (enabled in this vault).","x":10800,"y":3800,"width":3200,"height":1750},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-gap","type":"text","text":"# DATA / GOVERNANCE GAPS","x":10830,"y":5770,"width":1363,"height":170},
		{"id":"gap-1","type":"text","text":"## GAP 1 - Expense invoices: RESOLVED\n\nThe 35-item baseline lists PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 and LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 as two projects. On 2026-09-25 the owner confirmed they are ONE project, recorded as LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2 (DEC-20260925-EXPENSE-INVOICE-ONE-PROJECT), matching the BOD recording (T 03:09-04:39). Both baseline names stay on the card as aliases; primary line to WFX Finance.\n\nStill open: whether the earlier Export exclusion applies.","x":10900,"y":5960,"width":3000,"height":640},
		{"id":"gap-2","type":"text","text":"## GAP 2 - Canonical codes and status\n\nACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3 (baseline) vs ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0 (vault canonical); canonical used.\n\nStratova: one active PoC representation - Pattern Generation PoC (zone 06, discovery register). The closed PPJxStratova.AI record is kept in zone 08 for traceability.\n\nGLPI chatbot: described as the merchandising AI helpdesk per the owner's update; not heard in the part of the 24/09 recording received. Vault domain stays Internal Chatbot & AI Platforms.","x":10900,"y":6640,"width":3000,"height":640},
		{"id":"gap-3","type":"text","text":"## GAP 3 - Systems inventory\n\nSource: owner's operating-systems diagram. GTAS has 16 applications, not 15: GTAS Costing was missing from the list in circulation.\n\nMMSx (diagram) vs MMX (2026-09-18 ecosystem note): treated as one system, name unconfirmed.\n\nThe diagram stars GTAS Costing and highlights Production Planning without stating why. BOD 24/09: GTAS Compliance has no user and is dropped from the BOD slide; nothing is attached to GTAS Transportation. Both stay here because this canvas records the whole landscape.","x":10900,"y":7320,"width":3000,"height":640},
		{"id":"gap-4","type":"text","text":"## GAP 4 - Relationship evidence\n\nINTEGRATION only where validated: Material Allocation to WFX Inventory Control, Invoice Downloader to VNPT. PLANNED: GDI via WFX API, Costing via the GTAS/IED contract, Admin to E-office (blocked by the reopening fee). Everything else is DATA, KNOWLEDGE or AFFINITY.\n\nOwner decisions 25/09 after the recording: Sourcing chatbot reads Inventory Control, not MMSx; the IoT hanger attaches to Reporting & Analysis and Production Management; no badge on QC / Production modules; no line to GTAS Transportation. QSee to WFX QC dropped (vendor evaluation, not in the matrix).","x":10900,"y":8000,"width":3000,"height":640},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-qc","type":"text","text":"# 04.5 QC / TQM","x":8880,"y":6430,"width":844,"height":170},
		{"id":"proj-qc-defectdetection-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# AI Defect Detection\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|QC_DefectDetection_v1.0.0]]\n### On Hold\n\n**AI APPLICATION - computer vision (vendor)**\nDefect detection and classification with QC review. Vendor proposal and NDA only; not an approved PoC.\nBaseline: PPJxQSee.AI","x":8950,"y":6620,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"proj-qc-threadtraceability-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# RFID Thread Traceability\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0]]\n### Pre-PoC / Business Case\n\n**POC / EVALUATION**\nRFID thread identification and traceability. Business case only; no PoC approved.\nBaseline: QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0","x":8950,"y":7320,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-wash-samplingmanagement-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Wash Sampling Management Portal\n## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0]]\n### Analysis / Product Design\n\n**WORKFLOW**\nWash sample request, planning, result and approval in the PPJ Group Portal.\nBaseline: WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1","x":8950,"y":9130,"width":1450,"height":660,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"proj-wash-cowash-v2-0-0","type":"text","text":"# COWASH Wash Operations\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.COWASH|WASH_COWASH_v2.0.0]]\n### On Hold\n\n**SYSTEM - wash production (vendor)**\nWash production workflow and operational data. Distinct from the sampling portal.\nBaseline: PROD.COWASH.v2.0","x":8950,"y":9850,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-whl","type":"text","text":"# 04.6 WAREHOUSE / LOGISTICS","x":8880,"y":10710,"width":1590,"height":170},
		{"id":"proj-wh-awbextraction-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# AWB Document Intelligence\n## [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0|WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0]]\n### Active Development\n\n**AI APPLICATION - document intelligence**\nAWB image OCR and DHL shipment email in one project: parse, normalize, match by AWB number, validate, human review.\nBaseline: WH.AWB.EXTRACTION.v1.1","x":8950,"y":10900,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-log-expenseinvoiceprocessing-v1-2-2","type":"text","text":"# Expense Invoice Processing\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1|LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.2]]\n### Regional Rollout / UAT\n\n**AUTOMATION - expense invoices**\nOne project (owner decision 25/09) used by Finance, Logistics in-bound, export / import and other units. Regional tax templates and charge rules; UAT / rollout in HCM, Da Nang, Nha Trang, Ha Noi.\nBaseline: PPJ.ExpenseInvoices.v1.1 + LOG.EXPENSE.INVOICES.V1.2 (one project, confirmed 2026-09-25)","x":8950,"y":11600,"width":1450,"height":760,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-admin","type":"text","text":"# 04.9 ADMINISTRATION","x":8880,"y":1130,"width":1190,"height":170},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-fin","type":"text","text":"# 04.3 FINANCE / ACCOUNTING","x":8880,"y":2440,"width":1536,"height":170},
		{"id":"proj-fin-financemanagement-v1-2-0","type":"text","text":"# Finance AI Management\n## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0]]\n### Strategic Active\n\n**AI APPLICATION - finance analytics / control**\nWS1 financial reporting foundation | WS2 OC cost, profitability and variance control | WS3 factory cost integrity: salary, overhead, performance.\nBOD drill-down: Group > Company > Division > Sales Group > OC. Analytics and control, not a financial system of record.\nBaseline: FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.2","x":8950,"y":2630,"width":1450,"height":820,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-acc-grnsupplierinvoicebot-v2-3-0","type":"text","text":"# GRN Supplier Invoice Bot\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3|ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0]]\n### Production Support\n\n**AUTOMATION - transaction bot**\nPO, GRN, supplier invoice, validation and matching, then accounting entry.\nBaseline: ACC.GRNInvoiceMatching.v2.3","x":8950,"y":3510,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-fin-invoicedownloader-v1-2-0","type":"text","text":"# Invoice Downloader\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2|FIN_InvoiceDownloader_v1.2.0]]\n### Production\n\n**AUTOMATION**\nDownloads source invoice files from VNPT E-Invoice; session handling updated for VNPT's new protection layer. No accounting posting.\nBaseline: PPJ.InvoiceDownloader.v1.2","x":8950,"y":4150,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-acc-inventoryreport-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# Accounting Inventory Report\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0|ACC_InventoryReport_v1.0.0]]\n### Closed\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - reporting**\nAccounting inventory reporting. Distinct from the Purchasing Inventory Report.\nBaseline: ACC.Inventory.Report.v1.0","x":8950,"y":4850,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-exim-expenseinvoices-automation-v1-1","type":"text","text":"# EXIM Expense Invoice Bot (legacy)\n## [[03_Projects/EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1|EXIM.ExpenseInvoices.Automation.v1.1]]\n### Closed\n\n**AUTOMATION**\nLegacy EXIM expense-invoice automation, replaced by Expense Invoice Processing (LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing).","x":8950,"y":5490,"width":1450,"height":660,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-hr","type":"text","text":"# 04.8 HR","x":8880,"y":20,"width":499,"height":170},
		{"id":"proj-hr-employeedataplatform-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# HR Employee Data Platform\n## [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1|HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n### Production / Expansion\n\n**WORKFLOW - data standardization**\nEmployee data collection, validation and standardization into an Employee Master on HRIS; applicant extraction / prefill.\nBaseline: HR.SSPFD.Workflow.v1.1","x":8950,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-admin-expensemanagement-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Business Travel & Expense Management\n## [[03_Projects/ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0|ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0]]\n### Active / Requirement Refinement / UAT Preparation\n\n**WORKFLOW**\nPPJ internal Admin application outside WFX: request, approval, advance, expense, settlement. E-office link blocked: service stopped, reopening fee under re-quote.\nBaseline: Admin Expense Management.v1.1","x":8950,"y":1320,"width":1450,"height":840,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"hdr-grp-arch","type":"text","text":"# 08 ARCHIVED / CLOSED","x":10830,"y":1070,"width":1248,"height":170},
