		{"id":"proj-ai-automation-workshop-202606","type":"text","text":"# AI Automation Workshop (June 2026)\n## [[03_Projects/AI Automation Workshop|AI.Automation.Workshop.202606]]\n### Closed\n\n**ARCHIVED - enablement**\nWorkshop record. No active tasks.","x":10900,"y":1980,"width":1450,"height":540,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
		{"id":"proj-ai-automation-workshop-analysis-202606","type":"text","text":"# Workshop Analysis (June 2026)\n## [[03_Projects/Workshop Analysis|AI.Automation.Workshop.Analysis.202606]]\n### Closed\n\n**ARCHIVED - enablement**\nWorkshop analysis record. No active tasks.","x":10900,"y":2580,"width":1450,"height":450,"color":"#8c8c8c"},
