		{"id":"proj-pur-hmlabelprocessing-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# H&M Label-O Processing\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing|PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0]]\n### On Hold\n\n**AUTOMATION - rule-based**\nH&M Label-O processing; paused pending a scalable business case.\nBaseline: PUR.HM.LabelO.Processing.Automation.v1.0","x":100,"y":9590,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"poc-wizcore","type":"text","text":"# Wizcore\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Wizcore]]\n### Smart Factory Discovery\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Factory -> IoT -> Connectivity -> Integration -> Data -> Dashboard -> Traceability -> Analytics / AI.\nNo operational integration assumed.","x":-2950,"y":3550,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-sortech","type":"text","text":"# Sortech\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|Sortech]]\n### Technology / SI Assessment\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Potentially relevant to invoice automation, GRN workflows, WFX automation, reconciliation, approvals, agentic workflows and smart-factory integration.\nNo operational integration assumed.","x":-2950,"y":4250,"width":1450,"height":700,"color":"3"},
