		{"id":"proj-ext-academiccollaboration-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Academic Collaboration (UIT)\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1|EXT_AcademicCollaboration_v1.1.0]]\n### Active / Problem Framing\n\n**COLLABORATION**\nPrototypes, research, competitions and talent pipeline with UIT. Not a production application.\nBaseline: PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1","x":10900,"y":210,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"5"},
