		{"id":"hdr-grp-legend","type":"text","text":"# 09 LEGEND","x":-4570,"y":5810,"width":614,"height":170},
		{"id":"legend-coverage","type":"text","text":"# MODULE COVERAGE BADGE\n### ● live AI / automation coverage (production / support) - green\n### ◐ in development / UAT / planned - blue\n### ○ evaluation, on hold or historical only - grey\n### no badge - no project touches this module yet\n\nBadge = the most advanced project touching the module. By BOD decision (24/09) QC, Production Planning and Production Management carry no badge yet; their lines still show on hover.","x":-4500,"y":6000,"width":3000,"height":780},
		{"id":"legend-nodes","type":"text","text":"# NODE CATEGORIES\n### WFX ERP - purple\n### Third-Party System - brown\n### GTAS Internal System - indigo\n### Data / Knowledge Platform - teal\n### Shared AI Platform - pink group\n### Project card colour = STATUS (below)\n\nThe type is on each card under the status: AI APPLICATION | AUTOMATION | WORKFLOW | DATA PLATFORM | INTERNAL PLATFORM | IOT | POC / EVALUATION | COLLABORATION | ARCHIVED","x":-4500,"y":6820,"width":3000,"height":780},
		{"id":"legend-edges","type":"text","text":"# LINES (shown on hover / click)\n### INTEGRATION - confirmed system integration (green, solid)\n### PLANNED - planned or in development (orange, dashed)\n### DATA - data dependency / source (blue, dashed)\n### KNOWLEDGE - knowledge / RAG / reference (cyan, dotted)\n### AFFINITY - business relationship, no integration (grey, dotted)\n\nThe label always names the type, and PRIMARY marks a project's main module. Lines of closed projects are grey.","x":-4500,"y":7640,"width":3000,"height":780},
		{"id":"legend-status","type":"text","text":"# STATUS COLOUR\n### Green - Production / Operational\n### Blue - Active / Development\n### Yellow - UAT / Evaluation / Analysis\n### Orange - On Hold\n### Grey-blue - Maintenance / Support\n### Grey - Closed / Archived\n\nThe exact source status is written on each card under the project code.","x":-4500,"y":8460,"width":3000,"height":780},
		{"id":"proj-pur-inventoryreport-v2-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Purchasing Inventory Report\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Inventory Report|PUR_InventoryReport_v2.1.0]]\n### Production\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - reporting / visibility**\nMaterial, stock and availability visibility from WFX Inventory Control and MMSx. Reporting, not an automation bot.\nBaseline: PUR.Inventory.Report.v2.1","x":100,"y":6690,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-materialallocation-v1-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Material Allocation Automation\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0]]\n### Development\n\n**AUTOMATION - workflow / transaction**\nSurplus material: unreserve, find an eligible OC, reallocate, validate. First Sewing / Embroidery flow validated.\nBaseline: PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.1","x":100,"y":7390,"width":1450,"height":720,"color":"5"},
