		{"id":"proj-td-technicalknowledgeplatform-v2-1-0","type":"text","text":"# Technical Knowledge Platform\n## [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1|TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0]]\n### Sync Validation & Stabilization\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - knowledge foundation**\nTechnical knowledge from Style Library, BOM, GTAS IED and Consumption; the foundation of the Agentic Costing Platform. Not an ERP system of record.\nBaseline: TD.TechnicalKnowledge.Platform.v2.1","x":100,"y":3600,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proj-fab-fabricdatamart-v2-2-0","type":"text","text":"# Fabric Datamart\n## [[03_Projects/FD.Datamart.v2.2|FAB_FabricDatamart_v2.2.0]]\n### Support\n\n**DATA PLATFORM - datamart**\nFabric, hanger, QR and material reference data (Directus). Separate from CPD.\nBaseline: FD.Datamart.v2.2","x":100,"y":4300,"width":1450,"height":580,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
