		{"id":"proj-scp-sourcingchatbot-v2-3-0","type":"text","text":"# Sourcing AI Chatbot\n## [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3|SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0]]\n### Production\n\n**AI APPLICATION - RAG / chatbot**\nSupplier, material and sample search, comparison and sourcing knowledge from WFX Inventory Control and Raw Material Planning.\nBaseline: SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3","x":100,"y":5990,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-adhocindentsouth-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# Adhoc Indent Automation (South)\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam|PUR_AdhocIndentSouth_v1.0.0]]\n### Maintenance\n\n**AUTOMATION - rule-based**\nRule-based processing of repeated Adhoc Indents for the South region into WFX purchasing.\nBaseline: PUR.Adhoc.Indent.South.v1.0","x":100,"y":8170,"width":1450,"height":660,"color":"#6f8fa8"},
		{"id":"proj-pur-gdiautomation-v1-0-0","type":"text","text":"# GDI Automation\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0]]\n### Active Development / WFX API Integration\n\n**AUTOMATION - API-first transaction**\nGoods dispatch / goods issue posted to WFX Logistics Out-bound through the WFX API; API development and integration preparation.\nBaseline: PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0","x":100,"y":8890,"width":1450,"height":640,"color":"5"},
