		{"id":"poc-discovery-patterngenerationpoc","type":"text","text":"# PatternGenerationPoC\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_DISCOVERY_REGISTER|DISCOVERY_PatternGenerationPoC]]\n### DAF / Commercial / Technical Scope Negotiation\n\n**VENDOR EVALUATION - discovery item, not a project**\nScope: Pattern generation PoC. Do not reuse the historical PPJxStratova.AI code.\nAlso: PPJxStratova.AI - the closed Stratova record (zone 08). No production integration.","x":-4500,"y":2770,"width":1450,"height":720,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"poc-cand-cpd-in-house-pattern-generation","type":"text","text":"# CPD In-house Pattern Generation\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/CPD_IN_HOUSE_PATTERN_GENERATION_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|CPD In-house Pattern Generation]]\n### Internal Prototype / Evaluation\n\n**CANDIDATE - not a registered project**\nBuild an internal pattern-generation benchmark from techpack/image/measurement inputs with Pattern Engineer and CAD validation.\nCanonical code not confirmed.","x":-2950,"y":2770,"width":1450,"height":720,"color":"3"},
